pdKLpo01rWTsd3tze4d68MMtj2-6RAqil2zK4JdsyuA\"/><figcaption>福建省57歲李女脊隨內驚見數千條寄生蟲與神經緊密交織，清除過程「如同在湯裡撈麵條」。（微博@三農頻道）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T04:38:23.388969+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1500,"images":19,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}